#
# tests/insn/x86_64.symmetric
# ===========================
#
# Operand pairs whose exchange cannot change the result, in the format of
# tests/insn/aarch64.symmetric; the check skips their "operands
# exchanged" control and prints the reason.
#
#     ENTRY  PAIR  reason

vpadd_4u32  ab  lane addition is commutative
add_8u32    ab  lane addition is commutative
add_4u64    ab  lane addition is commutative
xor_256     ab  exclusive or is commutative
and_256     ab  and is commutative
